Description: communicate with Nessus scanner via XMLRPC
 Net::Nessus::XMLRPC talks to a Nessus 4.2+ scanner over its XMLRPC
 interface. This build carries PacketFence's patches: NBE report
 download (report_filenbe_download) and GET requests when there is no
 POST data.
